{"id":"659704","name":"酸梅排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659704/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肋排","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨冷水焯烫出血水后洗净备用。","img":"images/659704/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜洗净切片备用。","img":"images/659704/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酸梅酱备用。","img":"images/659704/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/659704/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入排骨翻炒均匀。","img":"images/659704/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"适量蚝油，生抽炒匀上色。","img":"images/659704/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入酸梅酱。","img":"images/659704/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/659704/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将排骨转入电饭煲中，焖煮1小时左右。","img":"images/659704/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"排骨焖软烂后收汁，洒上白芝麻即可出锅。","img":"images/659704/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659704/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659704/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659704/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}